title: IntroCall1
---
Lucas: Hey, what's up Sp1k3?
Samantha: Yo Luke! Got a job for us, check your email, I've sent you everything. You're gonna be so excited when you see the money we get!
Lucas: Hold up, you're not even gonna ask me how I'm doing? It's been a while since our last talk.
Samantha: I'm really sorry, but we have to hurry with this one, okay?
Lucas: Alright, when do we go for it?
Samantha: Today... I know, I know, you're gonna be mad about it, but I'm sure you WILL like it.
Lucas: Damn... but okay, I think I got it. You know, it's been a long time since the last job. My hands got a bit rusty.
Samantha: Chill, this one is gonna be easy. You have your guidebook in case you forgot something.
Lucas: Yeah, yeah, I know. I'll read that email and call you after.
Samantha: Okay, bye bro!
===
